---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout>
  <main style="padding: 2rem; max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto;">
    <h1>Architecture of <span class="k5">Kastle Five</span></h1>

    <div class="manifesto">
      <p>
        <span class="k5">Kastle Five</span> is an open-source network. Steady in our principles, we
        stick to the architecture of our kill chain; intent, discipline and
        faith. We build our defense. We engineer and persevere and brace
        adventure. We break hard and tank harder. We believe in the right of
        self-fortification. To burst through sea wind, and to become the
        Osprey.
      </p>

      <p>
        Sail the boat with recklessness out into the open. Crash the sky with
        your courageous fighter jet with the engine noise of a thousand
        screaming stars. Trust your dog when he barks into the dark. Follow a
        cardinal direction. Drink the Red Bull whiskey empty. Get a sunburn.
        Get a nosebleed. Pray. Learn which bridges hold and which don’t. Throw
        a couple heavy rocks. Heal your white-knuckles. Heal yourself steadily.
        Find connection with the body. Find a body of water and put your hand
        in the cold stream and remember you are made of weather too. Carry a
        gun to remind yourself of patience. Hunt a storm. Drag it home. Our
        retinas are all arcs and our armor is plated skin. Surrounding you is
        the human condition. Don’t take it for granted. For the boy or girl
        you once were, Be brave and be well. Emunah on a 5-bet.
      </p>

      <p class="verse">Nahum 1:7</p>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  h1 {
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .manifesto p {
    margin: 0 0 1.75rem;
    color: #111;
    max-width: 42rem;
  }

  .k5 {
    color: #ffce1c;
  }

  .verse {
    margin-top: 3rem;
    color: #ffce1c;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }
</style>
